Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.84,0:00:04.23,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,夏天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.40,0:00:06.50,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,夏天就得去海边！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.69,0:00:09.07,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,暑假的压轴就是海水浴啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.43,0:00:11.69,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,晴雯丽是第一次去海边吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.89,0:00:14.95,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是的！不过我已经在电视上见识过了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.77,0:00:17.99,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,等你亲眼见到 会震惊的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.05,0:00:24.79,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不就是那个嘛？比湖更大一点规模的...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.22,0:00:29.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是一点！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.17,0:00:34.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好大！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.22,0:00:39.39,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,这边世界的7成都是海
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.01,0:00:43.31,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,所以还有着能在水面起降的飞机...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.49,0:00:44.44,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.17,0:00:50.53,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你说7成 那岂不是这边世界几乎都是海了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.87,0:00:55.99,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好了... 快点下水吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.46,0:00:59.03,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 是！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.53,0:01:02.25,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.25,0:01:08.35,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,噗哈！哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.88,0:01:14.04,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,大海... 玩不来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.22,0:01:15.67,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,...可别跟我说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.98,0:01:19.58,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴不会游泳吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.15,0:03:00.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}波澜壮阔的大海！海滨乐园！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.38,0:03:05.76,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴居然不会游泳 出乎意料啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.77,0:03:13.13,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝天大地的湖 可以靠毅力和信念走过去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.77,0:03:13.13,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(534,975)}{\fs50}Skyland
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.35,0:03:18.04,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,从湖底走过去的啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.20,0:03:19.11,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.25,0:03:24.54,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,还以为大海也没问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.85,0:03:27.42,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你真想从海底走啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.48,0:03:28.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.78,0:03:31.38,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,必须要尽快克服！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.17,0:03:34.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,地上几乎都是海
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.37,0:03:38.88,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,都没在这环境战斗过 只能说一直走运罢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.31,0:03:42.07,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不会游泳 妄为英雄！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.94,0:03:46.99,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,各位！请教我游泳吧！哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.74,0:03:51.98,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.97,0:03:54.75,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,就交给我来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.20,0:03:58.64,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,跳！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.43,0:04:05.02,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.59,0:04:07.01,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.72,0:04:19.33,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,太精彩了！究竟是怎么练成的？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.72,0:04:17.16,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an3}厉害啊 少年！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.72,0:04:18.55,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an1}太厉害了 阿翼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.80,0:04:23.54,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是还在蓝天大地的时候 擅长游泳的朋友教的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.09,0:04:27.07,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,游泳只要掌握诀窍 很简单的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.44,0:04:28.86,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.59,0:04:31.29,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,开始了！听清楚了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.92,0:04:36.23,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,首先 要像这样快速地扇动两边的翅膀
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.79,0:04:38.68,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an3}然后像鱼一样 运动身体...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.27,0:04:39.43,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,提问 老师！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.60,0:04:40.83,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.10,0:04:43.36,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,手能够代替翅膀吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.65,0:04:44.44,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.19,0:04:48.68,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,换我来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.00,0:04:52.57,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我在幼儿园的泳池里 照看过很多小朋友哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.76,0:04:54.50,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那可真是可靠啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.74,0:04:56.19,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,那么我们开始吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.67,0:05:00.09,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,对 慢慢地走！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.40,0:05:02.81,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,12 12
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.06,0:05:05.53,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,12 12...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.96,0:05:08.95,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我看她们都这样子30分钟了...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.34,0:05:13.27,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,在正式开始游泳练习前 夏天都结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.21,0:05:18.49,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,这下估计得我出面了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.85,0:05:21.17,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哦...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.34,0:05:28.44,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,太厉害了 真白同学！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.61,0:05:29.27,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,咻咻
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.60,0:05:30.67,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嘻嘻...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.51,0:05:36.35,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,还行吧 我在小学的时候 有上过游泳班
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.67,0:05:39.58,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是游泳8级的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.72,0:05:40.79,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.96,0:05:42.15,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,吧唧...？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.32,0:05:44.82,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯嗯... 有凭有据的实力啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.15,0:05:47.68,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好！我们开始练习吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.83,0:05:48.87,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.49,0:05:52.86,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,首先从浮水开始练习吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.21,0:05:58.71,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,放松身体 轻柔地
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.88,0:06:00.77,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,就像漂浮在天空中一样...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.05,0:06:04.62,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你来试试看吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.12,0:06:06.25,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.62,0:06:11.34,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不要怕 我会撑着你的 相信我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.64,0:06:12.66,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.30,0:06:16.53,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,放松身体... 浮起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.67,0:06:19.62,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哈 哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.05,0:06:21.00,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.56,0:06:23.86,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你太用力了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.15,0:06:29.81,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,就算你提醒了 我还是会紧张的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.52,0:06:32.69,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,把身体交给大海吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.02,0:06:35.48,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,随波逐流
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.67,0:06:39.12,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！把全身心都交给大海！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.55,0:06:42.99,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,随波逐流...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.70,0:06:44.98,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.59,0:06:46.87,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.60,0:06:51.45,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我做不到放松身体啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.06,0:06:56.64,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,必须要跨越大海... 跨越这道壁垒！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.01,0:07:00.89,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,不要焦急 寓教于乐嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.93,0:07:03.24,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.50,0:07:05.34,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,难得来一趟海边
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.68,0:07:08.52,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.96,0:07:11.83,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小螃蟹 真可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.24,0:07:13.22,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,胖蟹？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.45,0:07:15.63,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,是的！是螃蟹
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.00,0:07:18.39,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,剪刀 剪刀
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.79,0:07:20.88,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,胖蟹！胖蟹！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.05,0:07:23.09,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,剪刀 剪刀
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.38,0:07:25.33,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,对啊！要玩得开心！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.54,0:07:27.35,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.98,0:07:30.59,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,这是浮潜眼镜！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.01,0:07:33.90,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是能够一边游泳一边呼吸的道具
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.20,0:07:38.79,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,原来如此！有了这个就能够呼吸 就能够掌握游泳
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.31,0:07:42.18,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,看着我的示范来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.43,0:08:12.15,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才因为呛水手忙脚乱的 压根就没注意到
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.38,0:08:14.93,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太美丽了！大海！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.58,0:08:17.47,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,过来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.39,0:08:20.65,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我们借了游泳圈！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.99,0:08:23.37,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那个是...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.79,0:08:25.47,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不... 不会沉下去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.89,0:08:28.26,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,浮起来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.41,0:08:30.18,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,究竟是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.67,0:08:34.41,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,游泳圈里存储着空气 能够漂浮在水面上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.97,0:08:36.24,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,原来如此...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.19,0:08:40.21,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 我们来尽情享受大海吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.43,0:08:41.80,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.32,0:08:57.12,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,只要戴着眼罩 破开西瓜 就行了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.27,0:08:58.25,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.40,0:09:01.07,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,在开始前 还需要转3圈
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.97,0:09:03.23,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,加油啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.39,0:09:04.71,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,要命中哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.25,0:09:07.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.22,0:09:10.79,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an1}在右边！右边！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.34,0:09:11.85,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,在前面 前面
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.17,0:09:18.65,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这里！呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.88,0:09:21.39,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.55,0:09:22.95,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,直击命门！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.12,0:09:24.62,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你是怎么判断的？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.28,0:09:28.71,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我探查到了西瓜的气
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.22,0:09:30.86,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 腻害
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.45,0:09:37.11,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真好吃！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.29,0:09:38.89,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,夏天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.06,0:09:45.79,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,冰甜并头痛着...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.41,0:09:47.60,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 夏天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.54,0:09:49.86,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,要来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.44,0:09:51.67,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,加油！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.83,0:09:53.78,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,预备... 走！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.27,0:09:56.18,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,接球！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.14,0:09:59.07,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.91,0:10:02.00,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学！你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.13,0:10:06.08,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,没事 没事... 夏天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.64,0:10:09.92,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,仿佛要烧焦身体的太阳！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.90,0:10:16.03,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,仿佛要夺去双脚的热砂！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.93,0:10:23.18,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,无可挑剔的修炼场地啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.43,0:10:27.68,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,吾这在烈日炎炎下被逼入绝境的肱二头肌
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.86,0:10:29.40,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,正在大声悲鸣！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.60,0:10:36.93,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,肌肉的悲鸣越是大声 吾便越是强大！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.88,0:10:43.61,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,爱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.78,0:10:45.32,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.50,0:10:46.81,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,这些声音...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.03,0:10:50.54,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,这里再加一点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.88,0:10:51.60,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,爱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.76,0:10:53.91,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,请适可而止啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.17,0:10:56.02,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼 可帅了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.19,0:10:57.80,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是的！看起来就很强
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.60,0:11:02.85,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,混账Precure... 在这里碰上 真是冤家路窄！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.13,0:00:00.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.26,0:11:20.13,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,大海...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.46,0:11:24.34,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,与蓝天大地的湖 有着不同的美丽呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.80,0:11:29.82,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,能在暑假最后 跟大伙一起来玩 真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.89,0:11:31.77,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.41,0:11:38.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.70,0:11:42.08,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,完全被节奏带着走了...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.21,0:11:45.47,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,把游泳练习给抛在脑后了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.21,0:11:48.73,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.21,0:11:51.72,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你能游的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.90,0:11:52.94,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.10,0:11:54.85,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 我光顾着玩了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.64,0:11:58.09,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才说你能啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.15,0:12:01.71,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴就是太用力了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.30,0:12:06.16,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,这并不是必须要跨越的壁垒
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.17,0:12:09.21,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大海... 玩得很开心吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.81,0:12:10.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.21,0:12:13.62,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,那就好了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.19,0:12:17.70,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,真是悠闲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.95,0:12:22.49,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！是你...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.78,0:12:23.72,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,弥诺彤！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.91,0:12:26.79,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,大海是锻炼身心的神圣场所！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.04,0:12:31.18,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你们来到这里 居然不行修炼 光顾着打闹！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.64,0:12:35.50,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure！且看吾修炼的成果吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.05,0:12:39.14,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧！暗塌谷能量！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.63,0:12:49.11,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.06,0:12:52.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,游客们 快去避难
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.07,0:12:54.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,往这边走 赶快
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.43,0:12:55.37,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.13,0:00:00.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
