Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.01,0:21:08.48,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,豁然开朗
Dialogue: 1,0:21:05.01,0:21:08.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}豁然开朗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.13,0:00:00.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.30,0:21:16.78,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,修为不足啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.35,0:21:20.81,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,去找个地方 重炼吾的肌肉吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.39,0:21:22.84,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,弥诺彤彤！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.64,0:21:30.09,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,米丽
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.26,0:21:31.72,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很美丽
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.89,0:21:34.56,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,仿佛与天空连成了一体
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.96,0:21:36.08,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.15,0:21:42.08,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸 妈妈 暑假就要结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.08,0:21:46.65,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,今年夏天 快乐的事情太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.40,0:21:56.59,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,因为和大伙在一起 才度过了这最棒的暑假
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.52,0:22:01.55,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,真的太棒了... 夏天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.13,0:00:00.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.62,0:22:09.11,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我  Cure Precious！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.62,0:22:09.11,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1090,975)}珍奇愈卫！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.49,0:22:12.64,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大家来一起 美味微笑！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.49,0:22:12.64,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}{\fs50\pos(1090,975)}Delicious Smile
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.13,0:00:00.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.49,0:23:50.37,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 小空 梦幻般的可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.61,0:23:53.76,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,公主 说最喜欢我们了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.97,0:23:54.68,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.11,0:23:56.85,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才确实有人！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.01,0:23:58.05,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.91,0:24:00.21,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.91,0:24:00.21,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海阔天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.33,0:24:03.42,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,新的威胁！救回小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.04,0:01:24.25,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（冲上蓝天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.25,0:01:29.84,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 超越云巅
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.05,0:01:35.36,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飞吧！向着海阔天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.36,0:01:43.10,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空万里 美丽蓝天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.30,0:01:48.26,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨后初霁天空棱镜折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.50,0:01:52.51,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝天的景色预告着有好事发生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.51,0:01:53.99,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（蓝天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.99,0:01:58.26,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要确认一下 便伸直了双手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.87,0:02:02.87,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名为希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.93,0:02:04.83,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速紧握！紧紧握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.96,0:02:09.42,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,战胜绝望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.77,0:02:13.36,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.36,0:02:16.76,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦干眼泪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.41,0:02:16.76,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已经做好准备了吗）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.76,0:02:18.78,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飞跃而起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.16,0:02:18.78,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(让我们张开勇气之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.12,0:02:24.52,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 朝气蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.73,0:02:29.19,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把烦躁化为光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.44,0:02:34.49,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未来的图景 充满着可能
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.63,0:02:39.24,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,与在同一片蓝天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.62,0:02:42.01,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起唤起通向明日的奇迹！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.16,0:02:50.04,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海阔天空！Precure
